### Fazer login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}


### Listar todas as consultas
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllConsultas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}


### Buscar consulta por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getConsultaByID/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}


### Cadastrar consulta
POST http://localhost:40000/insertConsulta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "numeroconsulta": 1008,
    "dataconsulta": "2026-11-10",
    "valorconsulta": 150.00,
    "observacoes": "Consulta de rotina",
    "medicoid": 1
}


### Atualizar consulta
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateConsulta/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "numeroconsulta": 1001,
    "dataconsulta": "2026-11-12",
    "valorconsulta": 180.00,
    "observacoes": "Consulta de rotina atualizada",
    "medicoid": 1
}


### Excluir consulta
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteConsulta/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}